# Default game; once play has resumed after the first stoppage, the tracer
# forces the fight phase (4): FIGHT! banner, the fight (18) with a few
# punches, the result message (17), back to the faceoff.
@screen 1 +200 P1 START
#poke @screen 5 +200 FFC60C.w=0
#poke @screen 5 +200 FFC60A.w=4
@screen 18 +120 P1 A
@screen 18 +160 P1 A
@screen 18 +200 P1 A
@screen 17 +300 P1 START
@screen 17 +400 P1 START
@screen 5 #2 +300 END
